  "Dux Code is a native coding agent for the <a href=\"%2\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:%1;\">Dux Shell</a> desktop. The model is driven straight from a Go daemon over a Unix socket and everything is drawn with <a href=\"%3\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:%1;\">Quickshell</a> — no webview, no Electron.": {
